    "C’è un po’ di tempo prima che inizi il film."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:62
translate italian jamiemovietheaterstartdate_8da0039f:

    # "We just hang out and chat for a while."
    "Passiamo un po’ di tempo insieme a chiacchierare."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:65
translate italian jamiemovietheaterstartdate_592835a4:

    # "Finally the movie starts up and we go silent."
    "Finalmente il film inizia e restiamo in silenzio."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:67
translate italian jamiemovietheaterstartdate_b58e95c5:

    # "Jamie leans against me."
    "Jamie si appoggia a me."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:69
translate italian jamiemovietheaterstartdate_d41d8cd9_1:

    # voice "voices/jamie_049.mp3"
    voice "voices/jamie_049.mp3"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:70
translate italian jamiemovietheaterstartdate_40bb361a:

    # gnd "Want to mess around some?"
    gnd "Ti va di fare un po’ di coccole?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:88
translate italian jamiemovietheaterstartdate_fd60e14c:

    # "She reaches over and holds my hand on top of the arm rest."
    "Si sporge e mi prende la mano sopra il bracciolo."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:91
translate italian jamiemovietheaterstartdate_aee76b2d:

    # "The trailers take up about fifteen minutes, then the movie really gets started."
    "I trailer durano circa quindici minuti, poi il film inizia davvero."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:95
translate italian jamiemovietheaterstartdate_f9b1cbb0:

    # "During the movie, she keeps looking over at me."
    "Durante il film, continua a guardarmi."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:96
translate italian jamiemovietheaterstartdate_d6b093f3:

    # pc "You like the movie?"
    pc "Ti piace il film?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:97
translate italian jamiemovietheaterstartdate_18de1f8c:

    # gnd "Yeah, it's good. I just really want to kiss you right now."
    gnd "Sì, è bello. È solo che in questo momento vorrei davvero baciarti."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:99
translate italian jamiemovietheaterstartdate_4cdfc044:

    # "I lean in and kiss her."
    "Mi avvicino e la bacio."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:100
translate italian jamiemovietheaterstartdate_22ba9c92:

    # "We hold like that for some time before she finally pulls away."
    "Restiamo così per un po’ prima che lei finalmente si stacchi da me."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:101
translate italian jamiemovietheaterstartdate_9e25dd4e:

    # gnd "Okay, that will hold me over."
    gnd "Ok, questo mi basta per ora."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:102
translate italian jamiemovietheaterstartdate_3784a641:

    # gnd "Back to the movie."
    gnd "Torniamo al film."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:105
translate italian jamiemovietheaterstartdate_43311053:

    # "During the movie, she keeps looking over at me and smiling."
    "Durante il film, continua a guardarmi e a sorridermi."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:107
translate italian jamiemovietheaterstartdate_610dce56:

    # "She seems to be liking the movie okay."
    "Sembra che il film le piaccia abbastanza."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:110
translate italian jamiemovietheaterstartdate_ffcd1a92:

    # "She seems to lose interest in the movie fairly quickly."
    "Sembra che perda interesse per il film piuttosto in fretta."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:111
translate italian jamiemovietheaterstartdate_5973f780:

    # "I don't know. It's pretty fun to me. I guess she just doesn't like this kind of movie."
    "Non lo so. A me sembra piuttosto divertente. Immagino che semplicemente non le piaccia questo genere di film."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:114
translate italian jamiemovietheaterstartdate_4f23a069:

    # "During every scary scene that happens she tenses up and covers her mouth."
    "Durante ogni scena spaventosa si irrigidisce e si copre la bocca."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:115
translate italian jamiemovietheaterstartdate_603a9a9b:

    # "Sometimes she even puts her hands over her eyes."
    "A volte si copre persino gli occhi con le mani."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:116
translate italian jamiemovietheaterstartdate_288b2f3c:

    # "Then the music goes quiet, and I know that a jumpscare is coming."
    "Poi la musica si fa più sommessa, e capisco che sta per arrivare uno \"jumpscare\"."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:119
translate italian jamiemovietheaterstartdate_e86e1727:

    # "She grabs my arm and tucks her head down into it."
    "Mi afferra il braccio e vi affonda la testa."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:120
translate italian jamiemovietheaterstartdate_6bdb4e54:

    # "Her fingers dig into my arm, grasping it so tight."
    "Le sue dita mi affondano nel braccio, stringendolo con forza."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:122
translate italian jamiemovietheaterstartdate_e7200fcd:

    # "For the rest of the movie, I put my arm around her and hold her while we watch."
    "Per il resto del film, le metto un braccio intorno alle spalle e la stringo a me mentre guardiamo."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:125
translate italian jamiemovietheaterstartdate_ec13a563:

    # "The movie is funny from pretty much the very beginning."
    "Il film è divertente praticamente fin dall’inizio."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:126
translate italian jamiemovietheaterstartdate_4caf9a58:

    # "And we laugh together all the way through it."
    "E ridiamo insieme per tutto il tempo."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:127
translate italian jamiemovietheaterstartdate_7ad920fe:

    # "Even some of the scenes that aren't as funny, she laughs at."
    "Ride persino in alcune scene che non sono così divertenti."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:128
translate italian jamiemovietheaterstartdate_0d1cfe15:

    # "And seeing her laugh just makes me laugh too."
    "E vederla ridere mi fa ridere anch’io."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:129
translate italian jamiemovietheaterstartdate_d855e56b:

    # "Eventually the movie ends and the credits start rolling."
    "Alla fine il film finisce e iniziano i titoli di coda."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:132
translate italian jamiemovietheaterstartdate_0bcfb0ae:

    # gnd "That was a really sweet movie. Thanks for taking me."
    gnd "È stato un film davvero dolce. Grazie per avermi portato."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:133
translate italian jamiemovietheaterstartdate_4de625af:

    # pc "Of course you're welcome."
    pc "Ma figurati."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:136
translate italian jamiemovietheaterstartdate_f9724275:

    # gnd "That movie wasn't really my thing, but I hope you liked it."
    gnd "Quel film non era proprio il mio genere, ma spero che ti sia piaciuto."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:137
translate italian jamiemovietheaterstartdate_bfe93711:

    # pc "Yeah I though it was pretty cool."
    pc "Sì, l’ho trovato piuttosto bello."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:138
translate italian jamiemovietheaterstartdate_045099e4:

    # gnd "I guess so."
    gnd "Immagino di sì."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:141
translate italian jamiemovietheaterstartdate_6d2df7c7:

    # gnd "That movie was SO scary!"
    gnd "Quel film faceva TANTA paura!"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:142
translate italian jamiemovietheaterstartdate_5fcae4fe:

    # gnd "Thanks for being there for me though."
    gnd "Grazie comunque per esserci stato con me."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:143
translate italian jamiemovietheaterstartdate_737a7b53:

    # gnd "Sorry if I hurt your arm."
    gnd "Scusa se ti ho fatto male al braccio."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:144
translate italian jamiemovietheaterstartdate_00d236b5:

    # pc "It'll heal... eventually."
    pc "Guarirà… prima o poi."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:147
translate italian jamiemovietheaterstartdate_cd12116f:

    # gnd "That movie was SO funny!"
    gnd "Quel film era DAVVERO divertente!"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:148
translate italian jamiemovietheaterstartdate_e1a20436:

    # gnd "My chest hurts from laughing so much."
    gnd "Mi fa male il petto a forza di ridere."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:149
translate italian jamiemovietheaterstartdate_262d3cf7:

    # gnd "I loved it. Thanks for bringing me."
    gnd "Mi è piaciuto tantissimo. Grazie per avermi portato qui."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:151
translate italian jamiemovietheaterend_1a39771f:

    # gnd "Want to just sit and chat through the credits?"
    gnd "Ti va di restare seduti a chiacchierare mentre scorrono i titoli di coda?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:152
translate italian jamiemovietheaterend_61f77a4c:

    # pc "Sure."
    pc "Certo."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieDates/jamiemoviedate.rpy:156
translate italian jamiemovietheaterend_34bf5b34:

    # "When the credits end, we walk outside together and out to our cars."
    "Quando finiscono i titoli di coda, usciamo insieme e ci dirigiamo verso le nostre auto."

